@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L4：Pulsar Provider 发送结果映射

participant PulsarMessageProvider as Provider
participant PulsarProducer as Producer
queue PulsarBroker as Broker
participant "ProviderSendResult" as Result

Provider -> Producer: sendAsync(Message<byte[]>)
Producer -> Broker: publish

alt CompletableFuture complete with MessageId
  Broker --> Producer: MessageId
  Producer --> Provider: MessageId
  Provider -> Result: CONFIRMED + providerMessageId
else AuthorizationException / ProducerBusyException / InvalidConfigurationException
  Producer --> Provider: PulsarClientException
  Provider -> Result: REJECTED or FAILED + non-retryable failureType
else LookupException / BrokerMetadataException / ConnectException
  Producer --> Provider: PulsarClientException
  Provider -> Result: FAILED + NETWORK_ERROR / CLIENT_ERROR
else TimeoutException / future timeout
  Producer --x Provider: future not completed in confirmTimeout
  Provider -> Result: UNKNOWN + TIMEOUT
else exception after publish state unclear
  Producer --> Provider: exception
  Provider -> Result: UNKNOWN + UNKNOWN_OUTCOME
end

note over Provider
Pulsar sendAsync 如果没有拿到 MessageId，不能简单断定 Broker 没收到。
确认超时默认映射 UNKNOWN，由 message-core 决定是否继续重试。
end note
@enduml
